        <activityName xml:lang="en">Bus stop, asphalt pavement, complete pavement structure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Bus stop, asphalt pavement, complete pavement structure
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 544f4267-1436-4654-bb88-539ff884012b
This dataset combines the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of all layer types of 1 m2 bus stop (asphalt pavement) in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Predicted service life of 40 years, process inculdes replacement of pavement layers after the individual service life has been reached
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_544f4267-1436-4654-bb88-539ff884012b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
